Package: rdoc
Title: Type Annotations and Static Checking for R Functions
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R:
    person("Samuel", "Calderon", , "samuel.calderon@uarm.pe", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Provides JSDoc-style type annotations for R functions using custom
    roxygen2 tags. Enables static type checking through lintr integration,
    allowing IDEs to catch type errors before runtime.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
