    S7 (>= 0.2.0)
Suggests:
    lintr (>= 3.0.0),
    testthat (>= 3.0.0),
    withr,
    jsonlite,
    xmlparsedata
Config/testthat/edition: 3
Encoding: UTF-8
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE, roclets = c("collate", "rd", "namespace", "rdoc::roclet_types"))
RoxygenNote: 7.3.3
